1
00:00:00,562 --> 00:00:02,982
(Leonard:)I feel like
we're forgetting something important.

2
00:00:03,148 --> 00:00:05,568
(Raj:)Me too, but what?

3
00:00:07,569 --> 00:00:11,699
(Howard:)Maybe a Tupperware bowl
of roasted potatoes and carrots?

4
00:00:11,865 --> 00:00:13,365
LEONARD & RAJESH:
Yes!

5
00:00:13,533 --> 00:00:15,113
(Howard:)Yes!

6
00:00:18,121 --> 00:00:19,451
(Sheldon:)Now remember...

7
00:00:19,622 --> 00:00:23,752
(Sheldon:)...you were given powerful
pain medication and a muscle relaxer...

8
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:27,380
...so don't operate heavy machinery.

9
00:00:28,798 --> 00:00:31,678
(Sheldon:)Try not to choke on your own drool.

10
00:00:32,635 --> 00:00:35,385
(Penny:)Wait. You have to help me get into bed.

11
00:00:35,555 --> 00:00:37,225
[CHUCKLING]

12
00:00:39,684 --> 00:00:42,144
(Penny:)Sheldon has to get me into bed.

13
00:00:43,396 --> 00:00:46,486
(Penny:)Bet you never thought I'd say that.
Ha-ha-ha.

14
00:00:47,567 --> 00:00:49,397
(Raj:)Yes.

15
00:00:49,569 --> 00:00:53,739
The charm of your drug-addled candor
knows no bounds.

16
00:00:56,076 --> 00:00:59,416
(Penny:)You know, people think
you're this weird robot man...

